{
  "slug": "wasp",
  "name": "Wasp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Enhances Claude for developing full-stack web apps with Wasp (React, Node.js, Prisma)",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `add-feature` (Add Wasp's built-in features to your app — auth, email, jobs, and more), `deploying-app` (deploy the Wasp app to Railway or Fly.io using Wasp CLI), `expert-advice` (Get advice on app improvements and functionality from a Wasp expert), `start-dev-server` (Start the Wasp dev server and set up full debugging visibility), `wasp-plugin-help` (Shows the Wasp plugin's available features, commands, and skills), `wasp-plugin-init` (Adds Wasp knowledge, LLM-friendly documentation fetching instructions, and best practices to your project's CLAUDE.md or AGENTS.md file)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `chrome-devtools`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install wasp@claude-community` from `wasp-lang/claude-plugins` (`plugins/wasp`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
